0..69 Comment "// A program decides `sqrt 2 < 3/2` through `std.reals.Eff`, the host"
70..98 Comment "// interface of exact reals."
99..101 Comment "//"
102..179 Comment "// The program gives the host the canonical bytes of a plan whose root is the"
180..259 Comment "// comparison, and the host replies a plan. `decide` mints a machine on the two"
260..331 Comment "// poles of the root: that it holds and that it fails. A quantum is one"
332..393 Comment "// certificate step, and the poles take their quanta in turn."
394..396 Comment "//"
397..471 Comment "// Within 16 quanta the pole that holds certifies. The checker replays its"
472..547 Comment "// certificate before the host replies `holds`. The other pole suspends, so"
548..624 Comment "// the machine spends 7 quanta. `gandr run comparison.gandr` prints `holds`."
625..701 Comment "// The same `decided` runs under a handler of this source, a second model of"
702..719 Comment "// the interface."
720..722 Comment "//"
723..798 Comment "// - see: `crates/surface-dispatcher/src/evaluate/reals/machine.rs` — the"
799..832 Comment "//   machines that the host holds"
833..909 Comment "// - see: `corpus/model/reals/boundary.gandr` — comparisons that no budget"
910..922 Comment "//   decides"
924..956 Comment "// The console\'s host interface."
